Source code for Practical Python

The directories named Chapter01, Chapter02 etc. contain
the source code from chapters 1, 2, etc. The listings
are numbered, so that Listing 1-1 is in file 01-01.py,
listing 1-2 is in file 01-02.py, and so forth. The code
samples that are not taken from numbered listings are
given more descriptive names. Also, if a numbered listing
needs to have a specific file name to work (that is,
a different name from the one created from its number)
then that number is given as a comment on the first line
of the code.
